WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Welcome to MX Terminal.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.720
Every African market, one terminal.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.080
One thousand and twenty five listed companies across Johannesburg, Lagos, Nairobi and Cairo.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:20.030
Sign in with Google, or create an account with your email and a password of at least eight characters.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.172
This is the board.

00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:27.964
Everything is end of day, priced at the last close, and it is all one screen.

00:00:28.314 --> 00:00:34.746
The tape runs along the top: the index level, then every security and its move on the day.

00:00:35.096 --> 00:00:37.640
On the left, the watchlist.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.184
Every company on that market.

00:00:40.184 --> 00:00:42.728
Click a name to load it.

00:00:43.078 --> 00:00:50.710
On the right, the session at a glance: advances and declines, top gainers, top losers, most active.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.804
It is keyboard first.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:58.548
Type a ticker, a panel code, or both.

00:00:58.548 --> 00:01:02.292
M T N, space, F I N, opens MTN's financials.

00:01:02.642 --> 00:01:08.114
The heatmap: every sector, sized by weight, coloured by the day's move.

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:12.952
Financials.

00:01:12.952 --> 00:01:17.440
Income statement, balance sheet and cash flow, from company filings, with the ratios worked out.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:21.978
News.

00:01:21.978 --> 00:01:26.166
Press headlines, the regulator wire, dividends and book closures, one wire per market.

00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:31.424
The screener filters and exports.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:36.332
Beside it: commodities, bonds, foreign exchange, time and sales, and ratings.

00:01:36.682 --> 00:01:41.818
The full written guide is on the site, under Guide in the top navigation.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.880
MX Terminal.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.592
Every African market, one terminal.

